==Trivia==
*The examine text is a reference to the same lyric in the song {{Wp|Bootylicious}} by {{Wp|Destiny's Child}}.
*While ordinary jellies in the Wilderness Slayer Cave drop coins only 1000 at a time, Vitreous Jellies spawning in the same location receive no such change.
*The design of the Vitreous Jelly is similar to a ''gelatinous cube'', a classic Dungeons and Dragons monster.

